/* SEC_COMMIT 0x8000000 | win32-reference (Win32 desktop reference only -- verify against the CE SDK; 2 statement(s), e.g. corpus/win32/api/winbase/nf-winbase-createfilemappinga.md) | also in: memoryapi.h, Windows.h | value printed only by the Win32 shared reference (a CE page documents the name; verify the number against the CE SDK) */
